{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52257","headline":"诗（幷序） 十八 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾家多有田，不善（戴校「若」）广平王（戴校「玉」）。\n有钱怕（项校「惜」）不用，身死留何益？\n承闻七七斋，蹔施鬼来吃。\n永别生时盘，酒食无踪迹。\n配罪剔（张改「别」，袁谓不误）受苦，隔命绝相觅。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}